    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Dive deep into the neon-lit realms of Tomb of AnuBI0S! You're AnuBI0S, the AI guardian forged to protect the deity RAm from relentless Organics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJourney through different monuments of the Robot enclave, dodge the undead forces of the profane army, defend sacred artifacts and navigate through an Egypt made of circuit boards and stone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the sands of digital deserts to the cores of cybernetic pyramids, the challenge escalates. Over 5 expansive themed levels, face enemies, hone your skills, and discover the tale behind RAm's divine vision.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTower Defense Platformer Hybrid<br />\r\nStory Mode<br />\r\nArcade Mode<br />\r\n6 Weapon Types with Upgrades<br />\r\nPlayer Upgrades<br />\r\n9 Turret Variations with Upgrades<br />\r\nMultiple enemy types<br />\r\nOriginal Soundtrack<br />\r\nUnlocks &amp; More",
    "about_the_game": "Dive deep into the neon-lit realms of Tomb of AnuBI0S! You're AnuBI0S, the AI guardian forged to protect the deity RAm from relentless Organics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJourney through different monuments of the Robot enclave, dodge the undead forces of the profane army, defend sacred artifacts and navigate through an Egypt made of circuit boards and stone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the sands of digital deserts to the cores of cybernetic pyramids, the challenge escalates. Over 5 expansive themed levels, face enemies, hone your skills, and discover the tale behind RAm's divine vision.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTower Defense Platformer Hybrid<br />\r\nStory Mode<br />\r\nArcade Mode<br />\r\n6 Weapon Types with Upgrades<br />\r\nPlayer Upgrades<br />\r\n9 Turret Variations with Upgrades<br />\r\nMultiple enemy types<br />\r\nOriginal Soundtrack<br />\r\nUnlocks &amp; More",
    "short_description": "Tomb of AnuBI0S is an unique 2D tower defense-platformer with an Egyptian Sci-fi setting. Defend the AI deity RAm from waves of undead &quot;Organics.&quot; Upgrade your arsenal from weapons to walls, turrets, and your player capabilities. Immerse yourself in meticulously crafted levels and defend RAm!",
